"Seed News - ByteDance Seed Team (https://seed.bytedance.com/en/blog/deeper-thinking-more-accurate-generation-introducing-seedream-5-0-lite)\nciteturn31736search0 [wordlim: 200] Published: 7 months ago; Crawled: today; 2026-02-13 ... With its rich knowledge structure and deep reasoning capabilities, Seedream 5.0 Lite's information visualization ability has been greatly enhanced, making it suitable for productivity scenarios such as office work, education, and research. ... > Prompt: Search the weather, temperature, and time for the following locations on February 4, 2026: 1.\n\n# Deeper Thinking, More Accurate Generation | Introducing Seedream 5.0 Lite\n\nDeeper Thinking, More Accurate Generation | Introducing Seedream 5.0 Lite\n\nDate\n\n2026-02-13\n\nCategory\n\nVisual\n\nIn September last year, we launched Seedream 4.0, a unified image creation model that combined some common sense and reasoning capabilities, which received positive feedback from many users.\n\nToday, we introduce the latest intelligent image creation model, Seedream 5.0 Lite. Compared to version 4.0, it offers comprehensive improvements in understanding, reasoning, and generation, making it a \"smarter\" and \"more professional\" visual creative buddy.\n\nThe main improvement brought by Seedream 5.0 Lite is not higher resolution or faster speed, but the deep thinking behind \"reading\", \"seeing\", \"drawing\", and \"writing\". As a step towards a unified multimodal model, it starts to \"understand\" the intentions behind user instructions like a human designer, \"see\" the patterns in different images, and apply world knowledge to both image and text creation.\n\nIn addition, we've introduced real-time search enhancement for the Seedream model. It can now access up-to-date knowledge and information through the internet, allowing for more accurate responses to time-sensitive creative needs. Core highlights of Seedream 5.0 Lite are as follows:\n\n  * Improved understanding and generation: The model uses a unified multimodal architecture that further enhances cross-modal understanding and reasoning. This allows the model to capture the key features of reference images more deeply and understand vague user instructions more accurately, generating content that better aligns with user intention. At the same time, the model's performance in areas such as subject consistency and image-text alignment has significantly improved.\n\n  * Enhanced world knowledge structure: The model is equipped with rich world knowledge, covering various verticals in both technology and humanities. With the improvement of the knowledge system, the generated outputs are more aligned with physical laws, and information visualization has greatly improved.\n\n  * Real-time search extends knowledge limits: The model can more effectively respond to time-sensitive generation needs, making it especially suitable for scenarios such as generating creative materials with real-time information.\n\nIn comprehensive evaluations, Seedream 5.0 Lite's Elo score exceeds Seedream 4.5, with significant improvements in knowledge reasoning, editing response, and consistency. Its progress is particularly noticeable in real-world applications. Now, Seedream 5.0 Lite is live on platforms such as Dreamina AI and Volcano Ark Experience Center. We welcome you to try it out and share your feedback.\n\nNot Just Following Orders, But Truly Understanding Intentions\n\nA Whole New Level of Visual Collaboration\n\nWith a significant improvement in \"intelligence\", the latest Seedream model has transformed from an image generation engine that passively responds to instructions into a professional creative assistant capable of observation, comprehension, and logical reasoning. Here are some of the key ways to use Seedream 5.0 Lite:\n\n1. Visual Reasoning in Image Generation: Enables multi-step thinking to ensure realistic outputs that align with physical laws.\n\nSeedream 5.0 Lite is more than just a simple \"paintbrush\" — it first \"understands\" the input image and instructions, then uses logic to \"draw\". This enables Seedream to tackle visual reasoning tasks that traditional image generation models can't handle. It supports multi-step reasoning, ensuring that the generated results align with internal logic and physical laws.\n\nFor example, Seedream can now complete basic Go game reasoning, figuring out the next move and how the game might play out. When given scattered parts, it can infer what the object is and put them together in a sensible way, even if the user hasn't specified what each part is.\n\n> Prompt: In a Go game, after White's next move, capture the black stone.\n\n2. Information Visualization: Efficiently Generating Demo Graphics with World Knowledge\n\nWith its rich knowledge structure and deep reasoning capabilities, Seedream 5.0 Lite's information visualization ability has been greatly enhanced, making it suitable for productivity scenarios such as office work, education, and research.\n\nWhether it's restoring the vertical ecosystem of a tropical rainforest, labeling a petroleum geological profile, or creating diagrams based on formulas, Seedream can turn complex concepts into intuitive and visually appealing infographics, significantly boosting user productivity.\n\n> Prompt for image on the left: A vibrant, colorful natural ecosystem illustration showing the four vertical layers of a tropical rainforest (emergent layer, canopy layer, understory, forest floor).\n> Prompt for image in the middle: An English infographic of a petroleum system, showing an oil drilling platform and geological layers.\n> Prompt for image on the right: A high school math textbook illustration visualizing the geometric meaning of a function's derivative at a given point, with a white background, clear lines, and scientifically accurate details.\n\n3. Real-time Search Generation: Creating with the Latest Trends\n\nTo overcome the limitations of potentially outdated training data, Seedream 5.0 Lite introduces powerful real-time search capabilities. \n\nThe search function is flexible and can be toggled on or off. When enabled, the model stays up-to-date with trends and generates updated and relevant content. When disabled, the creation process is more stable, and users can switch as needed.\n\nImage: 图片\n\n> Prompt: Search the weather, temperature, and time for the following locations on February 4, 2026: 1. Beijing 2. New York 3. Tokyo 4. Sydney 5. Madrid. Then, create a composite photographic image based on this information.\n\n4. Precise style transfer: One-click \"synesthesia\" with a reference image to realize imagination.\n\nWords can hardly capture the subtle light, shadow, and brushwork in art. Thanks to the enhanced cross-modal understanding of Seedream 5.0 Lite, you no longer need to labor over complex prompts. With just a single reference image, the model can instantly \"synesthesize\" the style you desire.\n\nWhether it is the ornate Bohemian style or the texture of an Impressionist oil painting, it accurately captures the essence and integrates it into the generated image, transforming a casual snapshot into a work of art.\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt: Using the image below as a reference, apply its style to the image above.\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt: Change the color tone of image 1 to match that of image 2.\n\n5. Advanced image editing: Achieve precise edits with vague instructions\n\nWith its improved understanding and reasoning capabilities, Seedream 5.0 Lite has mastered more advanced image editing skills. Even when given short, ambiguous instructions, it can infer the user's underlying intent like a human designer and accurately deliver the desired results.\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt: Modify Figure 3 based on the changes observed from Figure 1 to Figure 2.\n\nCompared to previous models, the editing controllability of Seedream 5.0 Lite has been further enhanced. When performing local edits or subject replacement, the model maintains consistency in non-edited areas more stably, allowing users to make precise, targeted modifications.\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt: Change the lighting and shadows in the image to bokeh effects.\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt: Change the focus to make the foreground sharp and blur the person in the background.\n\n6. Complex multi-subject generation: Accurately follow instructions and render diverse subject attributes\n\nSeedream 5.0 Lite has also made progress in fundamental image generation. It captures detailed instructions within prompts with greater sensitivity, accurately interpreting and translating complex spatial relationships, specific object attributes, and even abstract emotional atmospheres into the final image. \n\nFor instance, even in visuals containing up to nine subjects, the Seedream model still successfully adhered to complex instructions, accurately rendering attributes such as letters, time, numbers, and colors.\n\nImage: 图片\n\n> Prompt: A 3x3 display shelf grid, front-facing perspective. Top-left cell: a transparent glass cube with a red rose suspended inside. Top-middle cell: a wooden sphere with the letter 'A' carved on its surface. Top-right cell: a metal pyramid reflecting a blue sky. Middle-left cell: a ceramic cat painted with gold lacquer. Center cell: a transparent clock with its hands pointing to 10:10. Middle-right cell: Exactly 6 green gemstones neatly stacked. Bottom-left cell: a burning candle with blue wax and a green flame. Bottom-middle cell: a cactus planted in a teapot. Bottom-right cell: a skull wearing sunglasses. High-resolution, photo-realistic, studio lighting. \n\nSeedream also achieves impressive results in complex scenes featuring multiple characters. \n\nGiven its enhanced intelligence and professional capabilities, we believe there are many more advanced ways to use Seedream 5.0 Lite waiting to be discovered.\n\nSeedream 5.0 Lite Evaluation\n\nSignificant Improvements in Office and Study Scenarios\n\nSeedream 5.0 Lite goes beyond improvements of fundamental capabilities. It focuses on practical, real-world applications for everyday life and work. Therefore, in our capability tests, we not only evaluated traditional metrics such as instruction following, text-image consistency, and overall performance, but also introduced specialized tests for high-frequency application scenarios, including knowledge reasoning, office and study, business marketing, creativity, and design.\n\nThe evaluation was conducted on the MagicArena platform, where we introduced various models for double-blind side-by-side comparisons. To ensure objectivity, all scoring was performed by senior evaluation experts in the field of image generation. Based on tens of thousands of rounds, we established a high-confidence Elo leaderboard.\n\nThe results show that, compared to the previous generation, Seedream 5.0 Lite has made significant progress in key fundamental metrics, including overall Elo score, instruction following, and editing consistency. It demonstrated stronger comprehension and execution, especially in scenarios involving knowledge reasoning and portrait enhancement. In real-world applications, particularly in office and study scenarios, its performance score has substantially improved alongside its enhanced reasoning abilities. This means Seedream 5.0 Lite is no longer just a creative novelty but a capable assistant integrated into users' work and daily lives.\n\nImage: 图片Image: 图片\n\nSummary and Outlook\n\nThe enhancement of its cross-modal reasoning capabilities and world knowledge has allowed Seedream 5.0 Lite to evolve from merely \"executing instructions\" to truly \"understanding intent\". This signifies a substantial improvement in overall image generation capabilities and will also bring about new, more efficient ways of interaction. In the future, users will likely no longer need to learn complex prompting techniques. By simply communicating their creative intent to the model, they will be able to complete image and text creation efficiently and accurately.\n\nThis shift also transforms the image generation model from being \"fun to play with\" to \"genuinely useful\", integrating it more deeply into productivity scenarios. The upgraded Seedream models can serve as a powerful assistant for everyday users, helping elevate presentation visuals, generate charts, and create posters, thereby significantly increasing their practicality.\n\nSeedream 5.0 Lite is a relatively small model, and there is still room for improvement in structural stability, realism, and aesthetics. Going forward, we will continue scaling the model to further elevate the intelligence and performance ceiling of the Seedream models and to support more rounds of interactive editing. We hope it not only helps users bring their ideas to life but also becomes a \"second brain\" that sparks creativity.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n团队动态 - 字节跳动Seed (https://seed.bytedance.com/zh/blog/deeper-thinking-more-accurate-generation-introducing-seedream-5-0-lite)\nciteturn31736search1 [wordlim: 200] Published: 7 months ago; Crawled: yesterday; 2026-02-13 ... 现在，Seedream 5.0 Lite 已上线即梦AI、火山方舟体验中心，并在豆包开启内测，欢迎体验和反馈。\n\n# “思考”更深，生成更准｜Seedream 5.0 Lite 发布\n\n“思考”更深，生成更准｜Seedream 5.0 Lite 发布\n\n日期\n\n2026-02-13\n\n分类\n\n视觉智能\n\n去年 9 月，我们发布统一编辑与生成的图像创作模型 Seedream 4.0，它融合了部分常识和一定的推理能力，受到不少用户的欢迎。\n\n今天，我们推出 Seedream 5.0 Lite 智能图像创作模型。相比 4.0 版本，它在理解、推理和生成方面全面提升，是一个“更聪明”且“更专业”的视觉创意伙伴。\n\n您的浏览器不支持视频播放。\n\nSeedream 5.0 Lite 带来的主要提升，不是更高的分辨率或更快的速度，而是贯穿在“读”“看”“画”“写”背后的深度思考。作为通向统一多模态模型的进一步探索，它开始能像人类设计师一样“理解”用户指令背后的意图，“看懂”不同画面中的规律，并将世界知识应用于图像与文本创作中。\n\n在此基础上，我们还首次为 Seedream 模型引入实时检索增强能力，它可通过联网检索，获取最新的知识和资讯，更精准地回应具有时效性的创作需求。\n\nSeedream 5.0 Lite 的核心亮点如下：\n\n  * 理解与生成表现全面提升：模型采用多模态统一架构，其跨模态理解和推理能力进一步提升。这使得模型能更深刻地把握参考图的主要特征，更准确地理解用户模糊的指令，从而生成更加符合用户意图的内容。同时，模型在主体一致性、图文对齐等生成方面的表现也显著进步。\n\n  * 世界知识体系增强：模型内置丰富的世界知识，覆盖科技与人文领域的多个垂类行业知识库。知识体系增强后，其生成结果更符合物理规律，信息可视化能力也大幅提升。\n\n  * 实时检索让“大脑”突破局限：模型可更有效地响应具有时效性的生成需求，尤其适合资讯海报生成等场景。\n\n在综合评测中，Seedream 5.0 Lite 的 Elo 评分超越 Seedream 4.5，其知识推理、编辑响应与一致性保持等能力提升显著，在真实落地场景中进步尤为突出。现在，Seedream 5.0 Lite 已上线即梦AI、火山方舟体验中心，并在豆包开启内测，欢迎体验和反馈。\n\n> 项目主页：\n> \n> https://seed.bytedance.c om/seedream5_0_l ite\n> \n> 体验链接：\n> \n> 1）即梦网页端-图片生成-选择图片 5.0 Lite；\n> \n> 2）火山方舟体验中心-视觉模型-图片生成-Doubao-Seedream-5.0-lite。\n\n## 不止听令，更懂所想\n\n## 视觉协作体验再升级\n\n得益于“智力”的大幅提升，Seedream 最新模型不再仅是一个被动接收指令的绘图引擎，而是进化为一个具备观察力、理解力和逻辑力的专业创作助手。以下是我们总结的 Seedream 5.0 Lite 的几种基础玩法：\n\n1. 视觉推理生图：支持多步思考，让生成符合现实规律\n\nSeedream 5.0 Lite 不只是一支简单的“画笔”，它能先“看懂”输入的图像和指令，再符合逻辑地“画图”。这一特点，让 Seedream 可执行传统图像生成模型难以胜任的视觉思考任务，并支持多步推理，让生成结果符合内在逻辑与物理规律。\n\n例如，Seedream 开始能完成简单的围棋推理，思考下一步落子和后续的棋局；面对大量散乱的零件，在用户未指出零件属性的情况下，它能推理出物体类型，并进行相对合理的组装。\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt：围棋对弈，下一个白子后，吃掉这个黑子。\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt：用图中所有的零件拼接成一个整体。\n\n2. 信息可视化：结合世界知识，高效生成演示配图\n\n依靠丰富的知识体系和深度推理能力，Seedream 5.0 Lite 的信息可视化能力大幅提升，可用于办公、教育与科研等生产力场景。\n\n无论是还原热带雨林的垂直群落结构，标注石油地质剖面，还是根据公式绘制展示图，Seedream 都能将晦涩的概念转化为直观、美观的信息图谱，提升用户的生产效率。\n\nImage\n\n> 左图 Prompt：一张丰富多彩的自然生态图，展示热带雨林的四个垂直层次（露生层、树冠层、灌木层、地表层）。\n> \n> 中图 Prompt：一张英文石油系统信息图表，显示石油钻井平台和地质层。\n> \n> 右图 Prompt：高中数学教材插图，可视化函数在某一点的导数的几何意义，白色背景，线条清晰，科学专业准确。\n\n3. 联网检索生成：结合最新热点，让创作贴近当下\n\n为打破模型训练数据的时间限制，Seedream 5.0 Lite 引入了强大的实时检索能力。无论结合当下天气情况生成城市海报，总结全球电影票房，还是绘制金价走势图，它都能基于实时检索结果，生成符合现实逻辑的内容。\n\n检索功能可灵活开关，开启时模型紧跟热点、内容鲜活；关闭时创作更稳定，按需切换即可。\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt：搜索以下地点在 2026 年 2 月 4 日的天气、温度和时间：1.北京、2.纽约、3.东京、4.悉尼、5.马德里，合成摄影作品。\n\nImage\n\n> 左图 Prompt：参考 2025 年全球票房排行榜前三名，设计一张充满未来科技感的电影票房排行榜，字体全部用英文，附上金额。排列尽量美观，避免单调无聊，霓虹灯感，好看，海报，大片。\n> \n> 右图 Prompt：请从 2 月 4 日起，生成最近七天的黄金金价柱状图（以国内现货计价，显示具体的数值&时间，非交易日略过，柱状图比例尺正确），一款时尚的玻璃拟态 UI 卡片。风格：磨砂玻璃效果。视觉元素：半透明模糊背景，流畅的金色渐变线条，柔和阴影，悬浮的 3D 金币图标点缀于四角，柔和的粉彩光效。\n\n4. 精准风格迁移：一键“通感”参考图，生成“艺术大片”\n\n文字很难穷尽艺术作品中微妙的光影与笔触。得益于 Seedream 5.0 Lite 跨模态理解能力的提升，无需再绞尽脑汁写复杂的提示词，只需一张参考图，模型就能瞬间“通感”你要的风格。\n\n不管是波西米亚式的华丽穿搭，还是印象派的油画质感，它都能精准捕捉神韵，融入生成图片，让随手一拍变成艺术大片。\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt：参考下图，将上图做风格转绘。\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt：把图 1 色调改成图 2 的色调。\n\n5. 高阶图片编辑：通过模糊指令，实现精准修图\n\n随着理解和思考能力的提升，Seedream 5.0 Lite 也掌握了更高阶的图片编辑能力。即便用户只给出简短、模糊的指令，它也能像人类设计师一样推测背后意图，并精准实现预期效果。\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt：参考图 1 到图 2 的变化，修改图 3。\n\n相较前代模型，Seedream 5.0 Lite 的编辑可控性也进一步提升。在局部修图或替换主体时，模型可更稳定地保持非编辑区域的一致性，按用户需求“指哪改哪”。\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt：将画面光影改为光斑。\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt：改变焦点，让前景清晰，人物虚化。\n\n6. 复杂多主体生成：精准遵循指令，还原不同主体属性\n\nSeedream 5.0 Lite 在基础生成方面也取得了进步。它能更敏锐地捕捉 Prompt 中的细节指令，无论是复杂的空间关系、特定物体属性，还是抽象的情绪氛围，都能被精准解析并转化为画面。相比上一版本，其生成中的“幻觉”与“遗漏”进一步减少。\n\n比如，在包含多达 9 个主体的视觉图中，Seedream 模型依然实现了对复杂指令的遵循，字母、时间、数字、颜色等属性均精准还原。\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt：一个 3x3 的展示架网格，正面平视视角。 左上格：一个透明的玻璃立方体，里面悬浮着一朵红玫瑰。 中上格：一个木制的球体，表面雕刻着字母'A'。 右上格：一个金属金字塔，表面反射出蓝色的天空。 左中格：一只陶瓷材质的猫，涂着金色的漆。 正中格：一个透明的时钟，指针指向 10 点 10 分。 右中格：整齐堆叠的六颗绿宝石，数量必须正好是六颗。 左下格：一根燃烧的蜡烛，蜡油是蓝色的，火焰是绿色的。 中下格：一个种在茶壶里的仙人掌。 右下格：一个戴着墨镜的骷髅头。 高清分辨率，超写实摄影，影棚光效。\n\n在多人物主体的复杂场景中，Seedream 也实现了较好的生成效果。例如下图中，模型参考内置世界知识，生成了 5 位艺术人物的“现代风”合照：不仅自然呈现了他们与不同道具的互动姿态，还通过推理精准还原了人物在反差场景中的神韵。\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt：五位艺术人物并排站立，人物保留油画质感，现代道具呈现照片级真实感。1）梵高：佩戴白色 VR 头盔，双臂盲目伸向空中，惊叹张口。2）弗里达·卡罗：俯身 DJ 台，一手按压耳机，另一手积极转动混音旋钮。3）戴珍珠耳环的少女：粉色爱心太阳镜，从容啜饮珍珠奶茶。4）蒙娜丽莎：佩戴亮黄色耳机，闭目微颔，单手轻托耳罩，随音乐律动。5）萨尔瓦多·达利：手持 switch，拇指紧扣摇杆，神情专注沉浸游戏。\n\n基于智能化程度与专业化水平的提升，我们相信，Seedream 5.0 Lite 还有很多进阶玩法，等待大家探索。\n\n## \nSeedream 5.0 Lite 评测\n\n## 办公学习场景提升显著\n\nSeedream 5.0 Lite 并非止步于基础能力提升，而是更加聚焦于“实用化”与“生活化”的真实落地。因此，在能力测试中，我们不仅评测了模型的指令响应、图文一致性、综合表现等传统指标，同时也引入了知识推理、办公学习、商业营销、影视游戏、艺术创作、设计等高频应用场景的专项测试题目。\n\n相关评测依托 MagicArena 竞技平台展开，我们引入了不同模型进行双盲对战打分。为确保结果的客观性，所有评分均由图像生成领域的资深评测专家完成。基于累计采集的数万轮对战数据，我们计算并输出了高置信度的 Elo 排名。\n\n结果显示，相较上一代版本，Seedream 5.0 Lite 在 Elo 综合评分、指令响应与编辑一致性等关键基础指标上均取得显著进步，特别是在知识推理、人像增强等场景，其展现出了更强的理解力与执行力。在真实场景中，尤其面向办公学习场景，伴随模型思考能力提升，模型实际表现得分大幅提升。这意味着 Seedream 5.0 Lite 不再仅是创意玩具，而是能走进用户工作与生活的得力助手。\n\n文生图评测表现\n\nImage\n\n图生图评测表现\n\n## \n总结与展望\n\n跨模态推理能力和世界知识的增强，让 Seedream 5.0 Lite 实现了从“执行指令”到“理解意图”的跨越。这意味着图像生成综合能力的显著提升，也将带来新的、更高效的交互方式。未来，用户很可能不再需要学习复杂的 Prompt 技巧，通过与模型交流创作意图，即可高效精准地完成图文创作。\n\n这一转变，也让图像生成模型从“好玩”走向“好用”，更多地融入生产力场景。升级后的 Seedream 系列模型，可以成为普通用户的得力助手，帮助美化 PPT、生成图表、制作海报，实用性显著增强。\n\nSeedream 5.0 Lite 是一个较小的模型，在结构稳定性、真实感和美感方面还有进一步提升的空间。未来，我们将继续 Scaling 模型，提升 Seedream 系列模型的智能水平和效果上限，并将支持更多轮次的交互式编辑。希望它不仅能帮助用户实现创意，还能成为激发创意的“第二大脑”，为商业广告、艺术创作等更高难度的创作场景提供创意支持。--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n团队动态 - 字节跳动Seed (https://seed.bytedance.com/zh/blog/%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83-%E6%9B%B4%E6%B7%B1-%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E6%9B%B4%E5%87%86-seedream-5-0-lite-%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83)\nciteturn31736search2 [wordlim: 200] Published: 7 months ago; Crawled: 3 weeks ago; 在多人物主体的复杂场景中，Seedream 也实现了较好的生成效果。\n在多人物主体的复杂场景中，Seedream 也实现了较好的生成效果。例如下图中，模型参考内置世界知识，生成了 5 位艺术人物的“现代风”合照：不仅自然呈现了他们与不同道具的互动姿态，还通过推理精准还原了人物在反差场景中的神韵。\n\nImage\n\n> Prompt：五位艺术人物并排站立，人物保留油画质感，现代道具呈现照片级真实感。1）梵高：佩戴白色 VR 头盔，双臂盲目伸向空中，惊叹张口。2）弗里达·卡罗：俯身 DJ 台，一手按压耳机，另一手积极转动混音旋钮。3）戴珍珠耳环的少女：粉色爱心太阳镜，从容啜饮珍珠奶茶。4）蒙娜丽莎：佩戴亮黄色耳机，闭目微颔，单手轻托耳罩，随音乐律动。5）萨尔瓦多·达利：手持 switch，拇指紧扣摇杆，神情专注沉浸游戏。\n\n基于智能化程度与专业化水平的提升，我们相信，Seedream 5.0 Lite 还有很多进阶玩法，等待大家探索。\nSeedream 5.0 Lite 评测\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn31736view0 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.CL/2602?skip=0&show=2000\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 1\nL0: Failed to fetch https://arxiv.org/list/cs.CL/2602?show=2000&skip=0: (404) Not Found\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nLatest News from Google Research Blog - Google Research (https://research.google/blog/)\nciteturn31736view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://research.google/blog/\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 185\nL0: cite0†iframe†www.googletagmanager.com L1: ## Explore our many areas of focus\nL2: \nL3: cite1†Explore all research areas L4: \nL5: Applied AI & sciences\nL6: \nL7: cite2†Earth AI cite3†Health AI cite4†Science AI cite5†Sustainability & crisis resilience L8: \nL9: Foundational ML & algorithms\nL10: \nL11: cite6†Algorithms & theory cite7†Informat